OL,3,AAI regulation faces political deadlock
OL,4,Aas calls grow for Congress to act
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump's view, unsurprisingly, is not
OL,7,Fshared by senior Democrats in Congress.
OL,8,FIt is also opposed by leading figures
OL,9,Fin the AI sector, who have in recent
OL,10,Fdays issued stark safety warnings and
OL,11,Fmade the case for government
OL,12,Fregulation.
OL,14,FIn the US, however, new safety
OL,15,Flegislation on AI is unlikely anytime
OL,16,Fsoon.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
